<h1>Graffeine Tales — Homepage Image Specifications</h1>
<div class='subtitle'>Artisanal D2C Storefront & Shopify Online Store 2.0 Asset Sizing Guide</div>

<p>This document details the exact display sizes, aspect ratios, recommended 2x Retina upload dimensions, formats, and compression budgets for every section of the Graffeine Tales homepage.</p>

