<h2>Detailed Section Guidelines</h2>

<div class='card-box'>
  <h3>1. Hero Showcase Carousel (#hero)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>CSS Render Rule:</strong> <code>width: 100vw; height: clamp(480px, 45vw, 640px); object-fit: cover;</code></li>
    <li><strong>Desktop Recommended Dimensions:</strong> <span class='highlight'>1920 × 800 px</span> (Standard 1080p) or <span class='highlight'>2400 × 1000 px</span> (Retina).</li>
    <li><strong>Mobile Viewport:</strong> Clamps to 480px height; images scale seamlessly from the center.</li>
    <li><strong>Art Direction:</strong> Warm, tactile flatlays of open journals, brass pens, wax seals, and espresso. Keep primary focal objects in the center 60% of the canvas.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class='card-box'>
  <h3>2. Shop by Category Strip (#category-section)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>CSS Render Rule:</strong> <code>aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.34; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 14px;</code></li>
    <li><strong>Recommended Dimensions:</strong> <span class='highlight'>600 × 800 px</span> (Portrait ratio 3:4).</li>
    <li><strong>Display Dimensions:</strong> Desktop 155 × 208 px | Mobile 125 × 168 px.</li>
    <li><strong>Art Direction:</strong> High-contrast editorial texture photography (e.g. linen bookcloth, teakwood coasters, brass bookmark).</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class='card-box'>
  <h3>3. Product Cards Across All Collections</h3>
  <p>Applies to <strong>New Launch</strong>, <strong>Bestsellers</strong>, <strong>Built with Heart</strong>, and <strong>Artisanal Catalog</strong>.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>CSS Render Rule:</strong> <code>aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; height: 240px–250px; background: #F8F6F0; object-fit: contain;</code></li>
    <li><strong>Recommended Dimensions (4:5 Ratio):</strong> <span class='highlight'>1000 × 1250 px</span>.</li>
    <li><strong>Recommended Dimensions (1:1 Square Alternative):</strong> <span class='highlight'>1200 × 1200 px</span>.</li>
    <li><strong>Art Direction:</strong> Clean studio photography with 8–10% internal padding so products do not touch thumbnail borders. Soft natural shadow on warm ivory backdrop.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class='card-box'>
  <h3>4. Stories in Motion / Shoppable Reels (#stories-in-motion)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>CSS Render Rule:</strong> <code>width: 290px; height: 515px; border-radius: 20px; object-fit: cover;</code></li>
    <li><strong>Video Resolution:</strong> <span class='highlight'>1080 × 1920 px (9:16 Full HD)</span>.</li>
    <li><strong>Encoding:</strong> MP4 (H.264 video, AAC audio, 30fps). Target file size: 3 MB – 6 MB.</li>
    <li><strong>Fallback Poster Cover:</strong> <span class='highlight'>1080 × 1920 px</span> WebP / JPG under 150 KB.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class='card-box'>
  <h3>5. Founder & Craft Story (#about-us)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>CSS Render Rule:</strong> <code>width: 100%; height: 480px; object-fit: cover; border: 6px solid #fff; border-radius: 16px;</code></li>
    <li><strong>Recommended Dimensions:</strong> <span class='highlight'>1200 × 1500 px</span> (4:5 / 3:4 portrait).</li>
    <li><strong>Art Direction:</strong> Authentic behind-the-scenes studio craft photograph (artisan binding a book, holding tools, warm studio daylight).</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class='card-box'>
  <h3>6. Artisanal Footer Illustrations</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Central Desk Scene:</strong> <span class='highlight'>1800 × 500 px</span> transparent PNG (displays at max 900 × 240 px).</li>
    <li><strong>Corner Foliage Vines:</strong> <span class='highlight'>600 × 400 px</span> transparent PNG.</li>
    <li><strong>Bottom Flourishes:</strong> <span class='highlight'>400 × 200 px</span> transparent PNG.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<h2>Optimization Best Practices</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Format Priority:</strong> Use <strong>WebP</strong> as default for 30–35% bandwidth savings with JPG fallback.</li>
  <li><strong>Color Space:</strong> Export all assets in standard <strong>sRGB</strong>.</li>
  <li><strong>Quality Setting:</strong> Export at <strong>80%–84%</strong> quality for optimal visual sharpness without bloat.</li>
  <li><strong>Lazy Loading:</strong> All below-the-fold images use <code>loading="lazy"</code>.</li>
</ul>

</body>
</html>